31	 *  Given the plethora of final fields in the usual Fortress task, such a step
32	 *  would be a memory model disaster!  Instead, we generate code like:
33	 *    Fib$task0 tmp = new Fib$task0(arg);
34	 *    tmp.forkIfProfitable();
